<title>GREECE: Hellenic Techno rights issue approved.</title>
<headline>Hellenic Techno rights issue approved.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens bourse approved the 7.7 billion drachma rights issue by Greek construction firm Hellenic Technodomiki.</p>
<p>Hellenic Technodomiki will issue 5,500,000 common registered shares at 1,400 drachmas. The terms will be one new share per one outstanding.</p>
<p>Proceeds will be used for working capital purposes and new investments in equipment.</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
